WEBVTT

NOTE Draft subtitles for "street" — timed to the shot plan. Re-time to the final edit.

1
00:04.300 --> 00:07.800
Everyone at uni is talking about Pi.

2
00:08.300 --> 00:10.800
And you? What do you think?

3
00:11.300 --> 00:16.800
I want to understand, but I don’t know where to start. Where can I find reliable information?

4
00:17.300 --> 00:21.800
Try DigitalSaudi. Open the Pi Browser and type digitalsaudi.pi.

5
00:28.300 --> 00:30.800
It’s in Arabic! And other languages too.

6
00:31.300 --> 00:33.800
Tap search and type what you need.

7
00:40.300 --> 00:44.800
“Available today”… “Illustrative concept”… Nice that they make the difference clear.

8
00:45.300 --> 00:48.800
And everything shows its source. No promises.

9
00:49.300 --> 00:51.800
I’ll save it and finish later.

10
00:56.300 --> 00:58.800
Discover Saudi Arabia. Explore useful digital tools. Learn about the Pi ecosystem with DigitalSaudi.
